false,"properties":{"title":{"description":"a few words saying what this call does, for the person to read while it runs (e.g. \"Reading play's query\")","type":"string"}},"type":"object"}},{"Name":"artefact_write","Description":"Replace the whole artefact with text.","Parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"base_revision":{"description":"the revision you read","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"text":{"type":"string"},"title":{"description":"a few words saying what this call does, for the person to read while it runs (e.g. \"Reading play's query\")","type":"string"}},"required":["base_revision","text"],"type":"object"}},{"Name":"artefact_edit","Description":"Replace old_text, which must occur exactly once (or every occurrence with replace_all), with new_text.","Parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"base_revision":{"description":"the revision you read","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"new_text":{"type":"string"},"old_text":{"type":"string"},"replace_all":{"type":"boolean"},"title":{"description":"a few words saying what this call does, for the person to read while it runs (e.g. \"Reading play's query\")","type":"string"}},"required":["base_revision","old_text","new_text"],"type":"object"}},{"Name":"artefact_insert","Description":"Insert lines before a line number (one past the last line appends), or at the start or end of a section named by heading path.","Parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"at":{"description":"with heading: right after the heading line, or before the next heading","enum":["start","end"],"type":"string"},"base_revision":{"description":"the revision you read","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"heading":{"description":"heading path, outermost first; the last element names the heading, the ones before its nearest ancestors","items":{"type":"string"},"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"line":{"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"text":{"type":"string"},"title":{"description":"a few words saying what this call does, for the person to read while it runs (e.g. \"Reading play's query\")","type":"string"}},"required":["base_revision","text"],"type":"object"}},{"Name":"artefact_replace_section","Description":"Replace the body of a section, named by heading path, keeping its heading; with_heading replaces the heading line too, and body must then start with the new heading.","Parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"base_revision":{"description":"the revision you read","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"body":{"type":"string"},"heading":{"description":"heading path, outermost first; the last element names the heading, the ones before its nearest ancestors","items":{"type":"string"},"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"title":{"description":"a few words saying what this call does, for the person to read while it runs (e.g. \"Reading play's query\")","type":"string"},"with_heading":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["base_revision","heading","body"],"type":"object"}},{"Name":"artefact_set_frontmatter","Description":"Set or delete top-level frontmatter properties; the others, their order and comments stay.","Parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"base_revision":{"description":"the revision you read","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"delete":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"set":{"type":"object"},"title":{"description":"a few words saying what this call does, for the person to read while it runs (e.g. \"Reading play's query\")","type":"string"}},"required":["base_revision"],"type":"object"}},{"Name":"artefact_images","Description":"List the artefact's images — your screenshots, and files the person added (source upload): name, size, where each came from, whether its bytes were purged, and the budget's use.","Parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"title":{"description":"a few words saying what this call does, for the person to read while it runs (e.g. \"Reading play's query\")","type":"string"}},"type":"object"}},{"Name":"artefact_copy_image","Description":"Add a second name on an existing screenshot's bytes, e.g. to keep it before cropping.","Parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"base_revision":{"description":"the revision you read","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"from":{"type":"string"},"name":{"description":"lower-case letters, digits, '.', '-' and '_', ending in .png, or in .jpg for a copy of a .jpg; omitted, the chat picks a name; the artefact's text shows the image where it embeds ![[name]]","type":"string"},"title":{"description":"a few words saying what this call does, for the person to read while it runs (e.g. \"Reading play's query\")","type":"string"}},"required":["base_revision","from"],"type":"object"}},{"Name":"artefact_crop_image","Description":"Add a new screenshot cut out of an existing one, by a rect in its pixels (artefact_images gives each one's size).","Parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"base_revision":{"description":"the revision you read","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"from":{"type":"string"},"h":{"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"name":{"description":"lower-case letters, digits, '.', '-' and '_', ending in .png, or in .jpg for a copy of a .jpg; omitted, the chat picks a name; the artefact's text shows the image where it embeds ![[name]]","type":"string"},"title":{"description":"a few words saying what this call does, for the person to read while it runs (e.g. \"Reading play's query\")","type":"string"},"w":{"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"x":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"y":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"}},"required":["base_revision","from","x","y","w","h"],"type":"object"}},{"Name":"artefact_remove_image","Description":"Remove a screenshot's name. Its bytes stay while an earlier revision names them; purge frees them for good, and a revert cannot bring them back.","Parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"base_revision":{"description":"the revision you read","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"name":{"type":"string"},"purge":{"type":"boolean"},"title":{"description":"a few words saying what this call does, for the person to read while it runs (e.g. \"Reading play's query\")","type":"string"}},"required":["base_revision","name"],"type":"object"}}]
0 m2: system "This conversation has an artefact: one markdown document (Obsidian-flavoured: wikilinks, callouts, tags, frontmatter, footnotes) that you build with the person. They see it in a panel beside the conversation.\n- Put the document's content in the artefact, not in your answer; answer with a short account of what you changed and what is open.\n- Read before you write: artefact_read gives numbered lines and the revision, artefact_outline the headings with their line spans. Every write names base_revision, the revision you read; a write against an older one is refused — read again.\n- Prefer small writes: artefact_edit replaces a text that occurs exactly once, artefact_replace_section a section's body by heading path, artefact_insert adds lines; artefact_write replaces everything and suits a first draft.\n- Each write returns the lint findings for the lines it changed; fix what they report. artefact_lint checks the whole document and artefact_inspect lists its links, tags, callouts, code blocks and footnotes.\n- The frontmatter's chat_* properties (conversation, run, model, start time and more) are the chat's: it writes them into every revision; leave them as they are, keep the frontmatter valid YAML, and add your own properties beside them.\n- The person's settings decide whether you may write and whether each write waits for them; a rejected change is theirs to explain — ask, do not repeat it.\n- The artefact keeps images beside the text: artefact_images lists them. artefact_capture takes a PNG of windows of your task (with Apps), artefact_crop_image cuts a part out as a new screenshot, artefact_copy_image adds a second name on the same bytes, artefact_remove_image removes a name (purge frees the bytes). The person can add image files of their own (source upload), and can send any image with a message: it is then attached to that message for its turn. The person sees the images in the panel; otherwise you see one's pixels only through artefact_view_image, when the person's settings offer it. The images have a budget; a change past it is refused."
1 m3: system "The artefact is empty (revision 0)."
